# =============================================================
# CAREER ASSISTANT — .gitignore
# Published as a reusable template. This file keeps personal
# data and generated artifacts out of version control so a
# contributor's profile and applications stay private.
# =============================================================

# === Personal data — never commit =============================
# Every folder below belongs to the person running the tool.
# Each contributor creates their own files here (see README).
profile/
applications/
job_offers/
tracking/*
comparisons/*
career_preferences.md

# Local candidate configuration. Config.example.json is the
# tracked template; the real values stay local and private.
/config.json

# Keep the (generic, non-personal) docs that live inside the
# otherwise-private folders so the published repo stays useful.
!tracking/README.md
!comparisons/README.md

# === Opencode tooling (plugin dependency) ======================
node_modules/
.opencode/node_modules/
.opencode/package.json
.opencode/package-lock.json
.opencode/bun.lock

# === Python =====================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# === Generated / derivative outputs =============================
*.docx

# === Job discovery automation (private) ========================
discoveries/
scripts/jobs/job_sources.json
jobs.db
*.sqlite3
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
browser-profiles/
screenshots/
.env
.env.*
secrets/

# === OS noise ===================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
